<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24681" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδᾰτέομαι</span></b> , aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεδασάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.): </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> in
			reciprocal sense, <i>divide among themselves,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ κτῆσιν δατέοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.158
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Th.</u>
				606
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.51
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. τὴν ληΐην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.121
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in act.sense,
				<i>divide, distribute,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ παῦρα δασάσκετο</span> (
				Ion.
			 iterative form) <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				9.333
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς φυλὰς διεδάσαντο</span>
			<i>distributed</i> them among the tribes, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.145
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be divided,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆς διαδατουμένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					App.
					<u>BC</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
        </u> (Henry George Liddell, Robert Scott, Oxford, Clarendon Press, 1940) </div>
